                <pb facs="0128" n="782" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg782"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 169.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Address of the foreign representatives to His Majesty
                        the Tenno, on January</hi> 1, 1875.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sire</hi>: The foreign representatives accredited to
                    your Majesty’s court, desire to offe to your Majesty their cordial
                    congratulations on the occasion of the New Year. They regard with sincere
                    satisfaction the maintenance by your Majesty of relations of peace and
                    friendship with all foreign powers, and they trust that the year now opening may
                    be distinguished by the advancement and prosperity of your people, and by much
                    personal happiness to your Majesty and your august consort.</p>
            </div>
